meta {
  name: Phase 4 - Submit Settlement
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/college-admin/seat-cancellations/{{seatCancellationId}}/settlement
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{staffToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "case_type": "B",
    "refund_calculation_method": "percentage",
    "refund_calculation_value": 10
  }
}

docs {
  Records the settlement decision for one of three cases and advances the
  case from Phase 4 to Phase 5 (Final Clearance). Fully manual — no payment
  gateway call.

  - case_type "A" (Penalty Applied): also send `penalty_amount` (number).
    Recorded as paid immediately (same submit action as "Record Penalty
    Payment" in the UI).
  - case_type "B" (Refund Eligible): also send `refund_calculation_method`
    ("percentage" | "fixed") and `refund_calculation_value`. For
    "percentage", the refund amount is computed against the course's
    application fee (the only fee figure already known on this row). For
    "fixed", refund_calculation_value IS the refund amount.
  - case_type "C" (Standard Withdrawal, no refund): no extra fields needed.

  409 ConflictError if the case isn't currently at Phase 4, or if the
  case-specific required fields are missing (400 ValidationError).
}
